WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.520
*idle chatter between the studios*

00:00:04.520 --> 00:00:05.600
*banging gavel x3*

00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:08.320
[Madhouse]: Okay. People, we've hit a crisis.

00:00:08.320 --> 00:00:08.860
*DING*

00:00:09.380 --> 00:00:12.400
[Madhouse]: Anime sales have been going down, and I think we can all agree...

00:00:12.400 --> 00:00:14.780
[Madhouse]: We're running out of original ideas for anime.

00:00:14.780 --> 00:00:18.280
But, if we all put our minds to it, I'm sure we can come up with somethi-

00:00:18.280 --> 00:00:21.240
[Sunrise]: OOOH! OO-OOOH-OOOH! Ooh! OooOoooOoh!

00:00:21.240 --> 00:00:23.060
[Madhouse]: *Sighs* What is it, Sunrise?

00:00:23.060 --> 00:00:24.440
[Sunrise]: What if we make a new Gundam?

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:28.940
[Madhouse]: Oh, for god sake's we've been over this, Sunrise. You can't use Gundam to solve everything!

00:00:28.940 --> 00:00:31.300
[Sunrise]: What about.... giant robots?

00:00:31.300 --> 00:00:32.700
[Madhouse]: Or giant robots.

00:00:32.700 --> 00:00:35.120
[Sunrise]: What if... we made a show about a machine...

00:00:35.420 --> 00:00:40.300
A big machine! That looked like humans, but humans can actually pilot it!

00:00:40.300 --> 00:00:43.200
[Madhouse]: That's still just giant robot-- ohh-okay, you know what?

00:00:43.200 --> 00:00:45.560
No more giant robots, are we clear on that everyone?

00:00:45.740 --> 00:00:47.320
No more giant robots!

00:00:47.320 --> 00:00:48.780
[Sunrise]: Giant robot dragons!

00:00:48.780 --> 00:00:51.700
[Madhouse]: Does ANYONE ELSE have any different ideas?

00:00:51.700 --> 00:00:54.000
[A1 Pictures]: I don't see what the problem is.

00:00:54.000 --> 00:00:58.420
[A1]: I mean, if we just keep making SHOWS, somethin's gonna be good EVENTuallly. Amirite, people??

00:00:58.420 --> 00:00:58.920
*opening suitcase noise*

00:00:58.920 --> 00:01:02.680
[A1]: Here! Is anyone short on shows? I got plenty to spare!

00:01:03.140 --> 00:01:05.180
[A1]: Here's one for you, and another for you--

00:01:05.180 --> 00:01:07.380
[Ghibli]: I think you all suck and everything you do is trash!

00:01:07.440 --> 00:01:11.120
[A1]: Awww, don't be like that, Ghibli! Here! Have a show!

00:01:11.120 --> 00:01:16.420
[Ghibli]: I don't want your goddamn show! You think this waifu otaku piece of SHIT is worth calling ANIME?!

00:01:16.420 --> 00:01:19.820
[Madhouse]: Come on, Ghibli. Don't be an asshole. Not everything we've made is bad--

00:01:19.820 --> 00:01:23.440
[Ghibli]: HEY! At least I don't take 8 years to finish a goddamn movie!

00:01:23.440 --> 00:01:25.500
[Madhouse]: Alright, now you're just being a dick.

00:01:25.500 --> 00:01:27.800
*Ghibli's haughty chuckle and sucking in air*

00:01:27.800 --> 00:01:30.620
[Ghibli]: I'm sorry... how many Oscars have you all won?

00:01:30.620 --> 00:01:33.720
[Bones]: How about you keep on sucking Miyazaki's retired dick, Ghibli?

00:01:33.720 --> 00:01:36.780
[Ghibli]: How about you come back to me when you've made a critically acclaimed film?

00:01:36.780 --> 00:01:40.120
[Bones]: DO YOU WANNA FIGHT, OLD MAN?! LET ME SHOW YOU HOW TO ANIMATE A FIGHT!!

00:01:40.120 --> 00:01:41.880
[Ghibli]: FUCK YOU ALL! I QUIT!

00:01:41.880 --> 00:01:42.380
*sliding door closes*

00:01:42.380 --> 00:01:43.640
*stomping feet*

00:01:43.760 --> 00:01:44.260
*SLAM*

00:01:44.260 --> 00:01:46.180
[A1(I think?)]: Should someone go get him?

00:01:46.180 --> 00:01:47.260
[Madhouse]: He'll be back.

00:01:47.680 --> 00:01:48.280
Probably.

00:01:48.580 --> 00:01:51.300
[KyoAni]: Come on, everyone! Let's not fight.

00:01:51.300 --> 00:01:55.260
There's nothing in life that can't be achieved from sunshine and happiness.

00:01:55.300 --> 00:01:57.960
*innocently creepy giggling*

00:01:57.960 --> 00:02:01.740
[Madhouse]: If only we all could have your outlook on life, KyoAni. What's your secret?

00:02:01.740 --> 00:02:07.340
[KyoAni]: Well... uhh.... If I'm having trouble thinking of something...

00:02:08.060 --> 00:02:09.900
I guess having cute girls never hurts!

00:02:09.900 --> 00:02:12.340
[Madhouse]: Cute girls? You mean like P.A Works?

00:02:12.340 --> 00:02:14.840
[P.A Works]: I'm sorry, did someone just say my name?

00:02:15.180 --> 00:02:18.900
God, I look so fucking good today. Like my work, of course.

00:02:21.480 --> 00:02:25.460
[I.G]: Psst, remember that show I helped you with ages ago? How about we do a continuation of that?

00:02:25.460 --> 00:02:26.200
[Gainax]: HUUUUUH?????!

00:02:26.200 --> 00:02:29.080
[I.G]: The wacky one that got really popular on Adult Swim?

00:02:29.080 --> 00:02:29.700
[Gainax]: HUUUUUUUUH??????!

00:02:29.700 --> 00:02:33.480
[I.G]: Bwah, Fooly Cooly! HOW do you not remember Fooly Cooly??!

00:02:33.480 --> 00:02:35.300
*awkward silence*

00:02:35.300 --> 00:02:35.940
[Gainax]: HUUUUUUUH??????????????????????!

00:02:35.940 --> 00:02:37.560
[I.G]: Ah, screw it I'll do it myself...

00:02:38.060 --> 00:02:42.080
[Gainax]: Y'know, back in my day we didn't need to worry too much about what we were doing.

00:02:42.080 --> 00:02:46.540
All we needed was some... cool-looking stuff and.... giant robots.

00:02:46.540 --> 00:02:47.720
[Sunrise]: GIANT ROBOTS!

00:02:47.720 --> 00:02:49.520
[Gainax]: And everything would just work out!

00:02:49.520 --> 00:02:52.460
[A1]: Is that also how they taught you how to do endings, old man?

00:02:52.460 --> 00:02:55.600
*Everyone bursts into laughter*

00:02:55.600 --> 00:02:56.720
[Madhouse]: No, but seriously.

00:02:57.020 --> 00:03:01.900
[Shaft]: I see. I see shapes. I see... I see colors! Everywhere!

00:03:01.900 --> 00:03:04.960
[Madhouse]: Uhhhhhhhhh..... what.

00:03:04.960 --> 00:03:06.640
[(???)]: He's having one of his visions again...

00:03:06.640 --> 00:03:12.040
[Shaft]: What if... we had GIRLS! Except they didn't have necks! And they could TILT THEM!

00:03:12.340 --> 00:03:14.180
And they just kept TILTING?

00:03:14.440 --> 00:03:16.140
WE NEED TILTING NECKS!!

00:03:16.140 --> 00:03:19.440
[Madhouse]: How in the hell is this supposed to make us sell anime?

00:03:19.440 --> 00:03:23.300
[Shaft]: You'd be surprised! I'll call a guy. He can make this all happen.

00:03:23.300 --> 00:03:26.800
[(???)]: Does his name by any chance rhyme with Makiyuki Minbou?

00:03:26.800 --> 00:03:27.920
*dial tone beeeeep*

00:03:28.260 --> 00:03:29.060
[Shaft]: NO!!

00:03:29.060 --> 00:03:35.640
[Diomedia]: Guys, guys! Instead of arguing about concept, how about we start going back to the basics for now?

00:03:36.000 --> 00:03:38.880
[Madhouse]: That's... actually an excellent idea!

00:03:39.300 --> 00:03:40.980
...who the hell are you??

00:03:41.200 --> 00:03:44.320
[Diomedia]: I'm Diomedia! Y'know... Diomedia?

00:03:44.320 --> 00:03:46.000
[Madhouse]: Uhhhhhhhhhhhhh....

00:03:46.000 --> 00:03:52.100
[Diomedia]: I made Princess Jellyfish! Bokurano! KANTAI COLLECTION!! Come on, you guys must've heard of me.

00:03:52.100 --> 00:03:55.060
*extremely awkward silence fills the room*

00:03:55.060 --> 00:04:00.340
[Madhouse]: Oh...kay... well, I'm just gonna bring it over to you, ufotable.

00:04:00.340 --> 00:04:04.400
[ufotable]: Oh! Uh, well I think that-- *phone buzzes*

00:04:04.400 --> 00:04:07.480
[ufotable]: Sorry, I... I gotta take this. It-It's just the wife.

00:04:07.480 --> 00:04:08.620
Hi, honey. How are you?

00:04:08.620 --> 00:04:10.880
[Type-Moon]: Who the FUCK is Namco-Bandai?!

00:04:10.880 --> 00:04:12.540
[ufotable]: Wh-whoa, w-wait, what??

00:04:12.540 --> 00:04:18.380
[Type-Moon]: Here I am, taking CARE OF THE KIDS... and ALL I hear is that you've knocked up some other bitch you're with!

00:04:19.020 --> 00:04:20.920
[Type-Moon]: Who the FUCK is Tales of Zestria?!?!

00:04:20.920 --> 00:04:22.540
[ufotable]: Honey, can we talk about this later? I'm--

00:04:22.540 --> 00:04:24.060
Kinda in the middle of something.

00:04:24.060 --> 00:04:26.740
[Type-Moon]: Oh, no! You BETTER not hang up, you SON OF A--

00:04:26.740 --> 00:04:30.200
[ufotable]: *hangs up* Heh. Uh... I'm, sorry what were we talking about again?

00:04:30.200 --> 00:04:34.200
[Trigger]: ehHYYY, GUYS! WHAT'S HAPPENIN' OVER HERE?? WE HAVIN' A PARTY?!

00:04:34.200 --> 00:04:35.600
[Gainax]: Where the hell have you been?!

00:04:35.600 --> 00:04:38.540
[Trigger]: Me and Mappa have just been CHILLIN' and havin' fun!

00:04:38.540 --> 00:04:41.300
Somethin' you old folks j'st wouldn't understand!

00:04:41.300 --> 00:04:44.400
[Mappa]: He literally dragged me along. I didn't do anything.

00:04:44.400 --> 00:04:47.700
[Trigger]: Eyyyyy, MAPPA! We cool, RIGHT?! You had fun, didn'tcha?

00:04:47.700 --> 00:04:49.180
[Mappa]: Please, don't touch me.

00:04:49.180 --> 00:04:51.140
[Madhouse]: Wasn't Wit with you guys, too?

00:04:51.140 --> 00:04:56.040
[Trigger]: Oh, he got stressed about working on Attack on Titan season 2 and passed out at the bar!

00:04:56.040 --> 00:05:00.280
*Guren no Yumiya playing in the background*
[Wit drunk slurring]: It's comin'! I promise, ith's comin' sexhiser this time!

00:05:00.860 --> 00:05:03.900
[Wit]: Nanunahnuhehjeager... *hic*

00:05:03.900 --> 00:05:05.420
*plates breaking as Wit passes out*

00:05:05.420 --> 00:05:07.120
[Gainax]: Have you been drinking again?!

00:05:07.120 --> 00:05:09.720
[Trigger]: FUCK YOU, DAD! YOU DON'T CONTROL ME!

00:05:09.720 --> 00:05:14.000
[Gainax]: HEY, you show some respect for your elders! I taught you everything you know!

00:05:14.000 --> 00:05:17.600
[Trigger]: OH, PLEASE! Like you could produce anything good nowadays!

00:05:17.600 --> 00:05:23.060
In fact, all you old farts are getting past your prime! It's time for us young ones take over this industry!

00:05:23.060 --> 00:05:26.980
[Gainax]: Everything any of you have--
*Everyone yells over each other*

00:05:26.980 --> 00:05:29.840
*arguing gets even louder and louder*

00:05:29.840 --> 00:05:32.780
[Madhouse]: Hey, GUYS! GUYS!! GUYS!!!!
*still loud arguing but ends*

00:05:33.540 --> 00:05:37.640
[Madhouse]: Alright, so we're left with two options we can all agree on.

00:05:37.640 --> 00:05:44.360
Either we make an abstract, over the top, action show with cute girls and giant robots based on Type-Moon.....
*overlapping conversations from all the other studios*

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:46.320
*still overlapping conversations*

00:05:46.320 --> 00:05:49.540
[Madhouse]: OR... Plan B.
*overlapping muttering with Sunrise approving of robots*

00:05:49.540 --> 00:05:50.040
[Madhouse]: Boobies.

00:05:50.040 --> 00:05:51.320
[Sunrise]: BOOBIES!

00:05:51.320 --> 00:05:54.880
[Bones]: FUCK YEAH! THAT'S THE ONE! THAT'S THE ONE RIGHT FUCKING THERE!
*everyone in overlapping agreement of tits*

00:05:54.880 --> 00:05:56.900
*still overlapping unanimous agreement*

00:05:56.900 --> 00:05:59.400
[Madhouse]: Alright! I'll inform the Americans.

00:05:59.720 --> 00:06:03.040
[Madhouse]: Hey! Crunchyroll! Funimation! We've got a new show for you!

00:06:03.040 --> 00:06:04.540
[Crunchyroll]: Thank you very much! *phone beep*

00:06:04.540 --> 00:06:05.800
[Funimation]: Are we getting a new anime?

00:06:05.800 --> 00:06:08.320
[CR]: Yes, but you can have this one, dear.

00:06:08.320 --> 00:06:11.260
[Funimation]: Aww, thanks darling! I love you!

00:06:11.260 --> 00:06:13.980
[CR]: No-no-no-no-no! I LOVE you more!

00:06:14.520 --> 00:06:16.440
[Funi]: Noooo, I love YOU more!

00:06:16.440 --> 00:06:22.900
[CR]: N-n-n-n-n-n-no! I love YOU more!
[Funi]: No-no-no-no-no! I l~ove Y~OU MORE! &lt;3

00:06:22.900 --> 00:06:24.780
[Daisuki as voiced by Gigguk]: Oh, get a room already!!

00:06:24.780 --> 00:06:26.660
[CR]: Get lost, Daisuki!

00:06:26.660 --> 00:06:33.400
*classical violin orchestra music*

00:06:33.400 --> 00:06:34.920
Hey, guys! Hope you enjoyed that video.

00:06:34.920 --> 00:06:39.000
Thank you so, so much to Yusa from OtakuVs for doing the visual for this video.

00:06:39.000 --> 00:06:42.620
I came to him a few months ago with a script since I had no idea how I was gonna do it.

00:06:42.620 --> 00:06:47.380
I asked him if he could bring it to life, and I think he did an absolutely fantastic job.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.100
So I highly recommend checking out some of his work

00:06:49.100 --> 00:06:52.620
I'm also going to leave a link to the character models he did in the description along with his twitter.

00:06:52.620 --> 00:06:58.550
And if you like this skit, consider supporting me on patreon! But until then... I have been Gigguk, and I'll see you all next time.

